    "Surge reports each request's process and its parent. Tidemark walks up that chain until it reaches a monitored app, so everything below rolls up to %@, including processes that have already exited. Process IDs get reused, so each one is stored together with its start time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Surge 会给出每个请求的进程和它的父进程。Tidemark 沿着这条链往上找，直到找到被监控的 App，所以下面所有进程的请求都归到 %@，已经退出的进程也算。进程 ID 会被复用，所以每个进程都和它的启动时间一起保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
